  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bogota&apos;s Integrated Public Transit System Transformation Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Transformacional del Sistema Integrado de Transporte Publico de Bogota</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacin de prstamo es el mejoramiento del sistema de de transporte publico de Bogota. La operacion apoyara al GdC en la implementacin del Plan de Inversiones aprobado para Colombia del Fondo Climtico de Inversiones (Fondo de Tecnologa Limpia), y en particular en el programa de inversiones definido para el SITP de Bogot.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the loan operation is the improvement of Bogota&apos;s public transport system. The operation will support the GoC in the implementation of the approved Investment Plan for Colombia of the Climate Investment Funds (Clean Technology Fund), in particular in the investment program designed for Bogotas SITP.</narrative>
  </description>
